  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the ruins of the 'Dia De Los Drinks' bar, Static Peck lived most of his life scavenging for scraps and avoiding the dreaded 'Drip Collectors.' His knack for tinkering and chilling drinks into powerful weapons made him a valuable, but feared, member of the local flock.",
